<title>UK: Littlewoods to hang on to most UK stores.</title>
<headline>Littlewoods to hang on to most UK stores.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Littlewoods, Britain's biggest private retailer, said on Monday it would keep most of its stores and was launching a new trading format.</p>
<p>But the group told Reuters that it would realise value by selling &quot;selected&quot; properties. No figures were immediately available.</p>
